      "position_basis": "WGS_84 geodetic, read as (latitude, longitude, ellipsoid height) per Table 2.5.27-2 \u2014 note this is the OPPOSITE axis order from GeoJSON. No datum conversion. The source array is re-emitted verbatim at attributes.nits_position",
